<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for application for admission to the Herberger Institute School of Music at Arizona State University. We are pleased to inform you that you have been invited for a live audition/interview as a result of your prescreening submission. At this time we cannot schedule an on-campus audition because you are missing the following items from your application:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Transcripts - INSTITUTION</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Proof of English Proficiency</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">English Proficiency Exemption</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Letters of Recommendation</span></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><b>Transcripts</b>: Transcripts must be sealed and sent from the registrar’s office of each university attended. All international transcripts music be submitted in the original language accompanied by an official English translation. You may not complete your own translation. Electronic copies are NOT accepted and must be delivered to the address listed below.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Please send official transcripts, to the following address:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>If sending by U.S. Mail:</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Graduate Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">PO Box 871003</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 58287-1003</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>If Sending by FedEx, DHL or UPS:</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Graduate Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">1151 S. Forest Avenue, #SSV 112</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Proof of English Proficiency Exemption: </b>You may qualify for the English proficiency exemption if you have met the following:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">1. Successfully completed the highest level at the American English &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;and Culture Program (AECP) with grades of B or better</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">OR</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font><span style="font-family: arial;">2. Attended in person a regionally accredited college or university in &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;the United States and meet one of the following conditions:</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Earned a bachelor's degree or higher in the US, </span><b style="font-family: arial;">or</b></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Completed at least 12 hours of graduate coursework with a cumulative GPA of 3.0 on a 4.0 scale, </span><b style="font-family: arial;">or</b></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Completed at least 90 credit hours of undergraduate coursework with a cumulative GPA of 3.0 on a 4.0 scale.</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Letters of Recommendation</b>:&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">Letters are completed by your references listed in your School of Music Application through DecisionDesk. Please login to your account <a href="https://app.decisiondesk.com/login">here</a>&nbsp;to determine which letters you are missing.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We will confirm your audition/interview date once all above items have been received. Please bear in mind that audition/interview dates are filling quickly and that your desired date may not be available if there is a further delay in the submission of your outstanding items.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions about the above items mentioned, please contact <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">musicadmissions@asu.edu</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in studying in the Herberger Institute School of Music. We look forward to receiving your missing application items and scheduling your audition.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">ASU School of Music in the Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts</font></div><div><font face="arial">Office of Admissions</font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>